00:09:40,992 --> 00:09:51,492
所以上涨后出现看跌单印区，在K线或阴线顶部的单印区，或下跌K线或阴线顶部的单印区，表明买盘兴趣已枯竭。
So a bearish single print after an up move, a single print at the top of a bar or a red candle, a top of a down bar or a red candle indicates buying interest has dried up.

122
00:09:51,692 --> 00:09:53,892
市场缺乏继续上涨的动能。
The market lacks follow through to go higher.

123
00:09:53,992 --> 00:09:55,492
多头的买盘兴趣已经非常弱。
Buying interest has gotten very weak.

124
00:09:55,592 --> 00:09:56,992
所以你在这里能看到它。
So here you see it.

125
00:09:57,392 --> 00:09:59,192
它出现在这根阴线的顶部。
It's up at the top of this red candle.

126
00:10:00,892 --> 00:10:05,892
如果是阳线，它会出现在左下方，但阴线上是在右上方。
Which is on the green candle, it'll appear if it's in the bottom left, but on the red, it's on the top right.

127
00:10:07,392 --> 00:10:12,792
所以说多头在拒绝这些更高的价格，他们不愿意在这个价位以上继续推高。
So buyers are rejecting these higher prices. They're not interested. in taking it higher than this level here.

128
00:10:13,592 --> 00:10:17,592
然后，K线的价格回落，并且收盘价也更低。
And, you know, the price of the bar, it turned lower, and the bar closed lower.

129
00:10:17,592 --> 00:10:25,592
所以它会出现在阴线的顶部，阳线则出现在底部。
That's why it appears on a red candle, it appears on the top. The green candle, it appears on the bottom.

130
00:10:28,892 --> 00:10:30,792
接下来是小单成交，看涨的那种。
Small prints, a bullish one.

131
00:10:31,392 --> 00:10:33,992
在下跌后，出现在上涨K线的底部。
After a down move, a small print at the bottom of an up.

132
00:10:36,092 --> 00:10:38,492
这根K线应该是阳线。
Bar or a should be green candle

133
00:10:45,392 --> 00:10:47,892
显示卖盘兴趣已经枯竭。
indicates that selling interest has dried up.

134
00:10:48,592 --> 00:10:50,592
市场缺乏继续下跌的抛压。
The market lacks follow-through selling to go lower.

135
00:10:50,592 --> 00:10:55,192
小单成交由K线底部成交量与紧邻上方成交量的比率决定。
The small print is determined by the ratio traded on the bottom of the bar with the volume immediately above it.

136
00:10:55,392 --> 00:10:57,292
这里就是一根阳线。
So here you have the green candle.

137
00:10:58,192 --> 00:11:00,492
所以它在这里开盘，在这里收盘。
So it opened here, closed up here.

138
00:11:01,092 --> 00:11:03,492
下方的比率是 59.92。
And down here you have a ratio of 59.92.

139
00:11:04,092 --> 00:11:12,192
如果是蓝色数字，表示是小单成交，比率高于我设定的阈值，用来判断是否为小单成交。
If it's a blue number, it indicates a small print, a ratio above a certain level that I use to determine what is a small print.

140
00:11:12,192 --> 00:11:16,592
这里是黑色数字，所以这个比率并不提示我这是小单成交。
Here you have a black number, so the ratio doesn't indicate to me that this is a small print.

141
00:11:16,992 --> 00:11:24,092
但它显示的是，通过计算这些价格区间的成交量差异来得到这个比率。
But what it's indicating, it takes the difference between the volumes of the price levels here to give you this ratio.

142
00:11:24,592 --> 00:11:29,692
所以说，如果比率超过 30，我会认为这是小单成交。
And so if it's a ratio above 30, you know, I like to consider that a small print.

143
00:11:30,992 --> 00:11:36,192
这意味着下方的成交量相对较小，而上方的成交量较大。
It means that the volume down here was relatively small relative to the volume just above it.

144
00:11:37,392 --> 00:11:40,892
而在下一根K线，这个数值只是一个普通数值。
Whereas here on this next bar, it's kind of an... average number.

145
00:11:41,692 --> 00:11:45,592
我想看的是，比如15手对1200手的成交情况。
I want to see where it trades, say 15 lots against 1,200.

146
00:11:46,192 --> 00:11:49,492
这说明下方的价格正在被拒绝。
That tells me that there's prices being rejected down here.

147
00:11:49,592 --> 00:11:51,592
空头不愿意在这里卖出。
Sellers aren't interested to sell down here.

148
00:11:55,792 --> 00:12:02,692
好的，看跌的小单成交，和看涨的小单成交相反，它会出现在阴线上。
Okay, now a bearish small print, again, it's the opposite of a bullish small print, only it will occur on a red candle.

149
00:12:03,192 --> 00:12:09,892
所以在上涨后，阴线顶部的小单成交表明买盘兴趣已经枯竭。
So after an up move, a small print at the top of a down bar or a red candle indicates buying interest has dried up.

150
00:12:09,992 --> 00:12:11,792
市场缺乏继续推动上涨的买盘。
The market lacks follow-through buying.

151
00:12:12,492 --> 00:12:19,392
要让市场继续上涨，小单成交由K线上方价格区间的比率决定，与其正下方的成交量比较。
For the market to go higher, the small print is determined by the ratio traded on the top of the bar on the upper side with the volume immediately below it.

152
00:12:19,692 --> 00:12:21,992
这里的比率是28.53。
So here we have a ratio of 28.53.

153
00:12:22,792 --> 00:12:24,592
我把参数设置为28。
You know, I have my settings set at 28.

154
00:12:26,192 --> 00:12:31,092
这里17手对485手，比率是28.53。
So here you have the ratio 17 into 485 gives you a ratio of 28.53.

155
00:12:31,492 --> 00:12:32,992
这说明...
So it's telling you that...

156
00:12:33,692 --> 00:12:36,992
首先，这是根阴线。
You know, one, you know, it's a red candle.

157
00:12:37,092 --> 00:12:41,192
如果比率出现在K线上方，你就知道是阴线。
You're going to know it's a red candle if the ratio appears above it.

158
00:12:41,792 --> 00:12:43,592
如果出现在下方，就是阳线。
You'll know it's green if it appears below it.

159
00:12:44,692 --> 00:12:50,292
而且，如果数字是蓝色，说明符合你的条件。
And, you know, the number itself, if it's blue color, it'll tell you that it meets your requirements.

160
00:12:51,692 --> 00:12:53,992
我用30作为比率阈值。
You know, I use 30 as my ratio.

161
00:12:55,592 --> 00:12:58,892
所以说，我会寻找比率大于30的数值。
So anything, you know, I'm looking for numbers above 30.

162
00:12:59,492 --> 00:13:05,992
不过我的设置是28，因为我想看到28.52这样的数值。
However, I have my settings set at 28, particularly because I want to see numbers like this, 28.52.

163
00:13:06,292 --> 00:13:10,992
这不是一条死线，必须高于或低于某个数值。
It's not a line in the sand where it has to be above this number or above. below this number.

164
00:13:12,192 --> 00:13:18,792
我的阈值大约是30，所以29.12也接近30了。
My cutoff is around 30, so if it's 29.12, that's very close to 30.

165
00:13:18,792 --> 00:13:20,992
我会仔细查看这些具体数值。
I want to look at the individual numbers themselves.

166
00:13:20,992 --> 00:13:32,292
这更像是一个参考标准，但如果比率超过30，我肯定会关注；如果在28到30之间，我也会进一步审视。
It's more of a guideline, but definitely if it's above 30, but if it's a number between 28 and 30, I'm also interested in taking a look at it for further review.

167
00:13:35,292 --> 00:13:37,592
好的，接下来是大印。
Okay, the next one is large prints.

168
00:13:38,092 --> 00:13:45,692
在下跌趋势的底部出现的看涨大印，表明下跌过程中有强劲的被动多头。
Bullish large prints appearing at the bottom edges of a move down are indicative of strong passive buyers appearing in a down move.

169
00:13:46,092 --> 00:13:51,292
空头无法推动市场突破强多头所在的价格水平。
Aggressive sellers can't move the market through the price level where the strong passive buyers are sitting.

170
00:13:52,392 --> 00:13:53,692
所以你会看到这个比率。
So you guys see that as a ratio.

171
00:13:53,692 --> 00:13:55,092
同样，它会显示为蓝色。
Again, it's going to be blue.

172
00:13:55,492 --> 00:13:59,292
和小单成交不同，这是另一种数值类型。
Unlike a small print, It's a different type of number.

173
00:13:59,492 --> 00:14:11,892
它会是一个接近0的数值，通常在0.69或0.7到0之间，表示K线底部成交量很大。
It's going to be a number closer to zero, usually a number between 0.69 or 0.7 and 0, which will indicate that there's heavy volume at the very bottom of the bar.

174
00:14:12,792 --> 00:14:14,492
这种情况并不常见。
Now, it's not something you see very often.

175
00:14:15,892 --> 00:14:18,792
你懂的，一天下来可能只有几根这样的K线。
You know, over the course of a day, you may get only a couple of bars like that.

176
00:14:19,092 --> 00:14:22,092
但当它出现在波段终点时，就非常重要了。
But when it happens at the end of a move, it's very important.

177
00:14:22,192 --> 00:14:26,792
这说明那里有强大的被动参与者，愿意支撑市场。
It's telling you there's a strong passive participant there who's willing to support the market.

178
00:14:29,284 --> 00:14:35,184
在上涨行情顶部出现的大印，表明有强大的被动空头，就像你在这里看到的。
Large prints appearing at the top of an up move are indicative of strong passive sellers, like you see here.

179
00:14:36,084 --> 00:14:37,984
这里的比率是0.53。
You have a ratio of 0.53.

180
00:14:38,484 --> 00:14:42,284
这显示在K线顶部有强大的被动多头。
It's indicating strong passive buyers up here at the very top of the bar.

181
00:14:45,084 --> 00:14:46,784
这些人有大量供给要抛售。
These people have a lot of supply to sell.

182
00:14:47,384 --> 00:14:52,684
所以积极多头无法推动市场突破这些空头所在的价格水平。
So aggressive buyers are not able to move the market through the price level where these sellers are sitting.

183
00:14:52,784 --> 00:14:54,484
所以多头无法再推高价格。
So buyers can't get it any higher.

184
00:14:54,684 --> 00:14:57,584
有人有大量抛盘，并且愿意在那里压制市场。
Someone has a lot to sell and they're willing to hold down the market there.

185
00:15:00,464 --> 00:15:08,464
在高点附近堆叠卖出失衡区。在近期高点后出现的堆叠卖出失衡区，通常是供需关系转变的明确信号。
Stack selling imbalances around highs. Stack selling imbalances that occur after recent highs is usually a clear indication of a shift in supply and demand.

186
00:15:08,464 --> 00:15:13,064
多头将市场推高，但激进的空头介入并压制了多头。
Buyers have moved the market higher, but aggressive sellers have come in to overwhelm the buyers.

187
00:15:13,764 --> 00:15:19,764
就像我之前说的，我倾向于在高点附近做空，在低点附近做多。
Like I said, I like to take... Shorts near highs and longs near lows.

188
00:15:19,864 --> 00:15:23,564
你不总是有机会，但我喜欢有理由这样做。
You don't always get the chance, but I like to have reasons to do it.

189
00:15:23,564 --> 00:15:29,864
如果我在高点附近看到堆叠卖出失衡区，我会比在低点附近看到时更倾向于做空。
And if I'm seeing a stack selling imbalance near a high, I'm more inclined to take it than a stack selling imbalance near the low.

190
00:15:31,264 --> 00:15:34,264
因为那里更可能出现供需关系的转变。
Because that's where you're going to see a shift in supply and demand.

191
00:15:34,264 --> 00:15:38,564
你会在高点或低点附近看到这种转变。
You're going to see shifts. Around the highs or around the lows.

192
00:15:38,564 --> 00:15:43,164
你懂的，当需求在高点附近时，就是需求、需求、需求。
You know, when demand, you know, near high, it's demand, demand, demand.

193
00:15:43,164 --> 00:15:49,764
价格到达高点后，突然出现供给，市场开始下跌，供给方接管了市场。
You get it to the high, then all of a sudden there's supply, and the market sells off, and it becomes, you know, supply side taking over.

194
00:15:53,024 --> 00:15:56,724
相反的情况是低点附近出现堆叠买盘失衡区。
The opposite would be stacked buying imbalances around the lows.

195
00:15:56,724 --> 00:16:02,524
在近期低点后出现的堆叠买盘失衡区，通常是供需关系转变的明确信号。
A stacked buying imbalance that occurs after a recent low is usually a clear indication of a shift in supply and demand.

196
00:16:03,324 --> 00:16:06,724
市场从供给市场转变为需求市场。
It's gone from a supply market to a demand market.

197
00:16:07,124 --> 00:16:11,024
空头将市场推低，但积极的多头介入并压制了空头。
Sellers have moved the market lower, but aggressive buyers have come in to overwhelm the sellers.

198
00:16:12,524 --> 00:16:20,324
同样，市场逐步下探至低点区域，突然多头坐不住了，说：这价格划算，我要再买些。
Again, we're working our way down towards this low area, and all of a sudden the buyers sit up and say, hey, this is a good deal. I want to buy some more.

199
00:16:21,024 --> 00:16:25,624
所有人都积极买入，市场应该上涨，也确实会上涨。
Everyone is aggressive and buying it, and the market moves higher. It should move higher.

200
00:16:28,900 --> 00:16:29,600
背离。
Divergence.

201
00:16:29,700 --> 00:16:31,200
背离分为两种类型。
Now there's two types of divergence.

202
00:16:31,200 --> 00:16:33,800
一种是看涨背离，另一种是看跌背离。
There's bullish divergence. There's bearish divergence.

203
00:16:33,900 --> 00:16:37,600
看涨背离出现在市场创新低或平新低时，
Bullish divergence occurs when a new or equal low is made in the market.

204
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:42,000
此时Delta为正，且K线收盘价高于开盘价。
The delta is positive and the bar close higher than the level where it opened.

205
00:16:44,100 --> 00:16:52,700
在趋势行情中，你会遇到背离，
Now, in a market that's trending, you're going to get divergences, either buying divergences or selling divergences.

206
00:16:53,800 --> 00:17:00,800
但我不建议单纯依靠每个背离信号。
And I tend to like to not just take every divergence by itself. I like to get ratios involved in there.

207
00:17:01,300 --> 00:17:04,200
比如这里，可能没有比率，但有买卖失衡。
Like here, you don't necessarily have a ratio. You have an imbalance.

208
00:17:04,600 --> 00:17:11,100
除了背离外，我还想要额外的信号，因为有些日子市场似乎只朝一个方向走。
I like to get a little something extra besides just divergence because there are days when the market just seems like it's a one-way street.

209
00:17:11,700 --> 00:17:15,600
如果你尝试在市场中卖出每个背离，行情却持续上涨。
And if you're trying to sell every divergence in the market, it keeps on rallying.

210
00:17:15,600 --> 00:17:18,400
你很快就会亏得一塌糊涂。
You're going to end up in the poorhouse pretty quick.

211
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:29,100
不过，为了解释清楚，背离出现在新低处出现正Delta时。
But, you know, just for explanation's sake, a divergence occurs when you have a positive delta at a new low.

212
00:17:29,700 --> 00:17:31,500
新低处本应出现负Delta。
You should have a negative delta at a new low.

213
00:17:34,420 --> 00:17:42,120
而看跌背离则相反，出现在市场创新高或平高时，Delta为负，且K线收盘价低于开盘价。
Now a bearish divergence, again, it's the opposite. It occurs when a new or equal high is made in the market. The delta is negative. The bar close lower than where it opened.

214
00:17:42,620 --> 00:17:48,520
所以这里是新高，Delta是负的，也就是这个向下的三角形，出现负Delta。
So again, here's your new high. You have a delta. That's this down triangle. And you got a negative delta.

215
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:59,520
现在，我的软件与市场上大多数软件不同的一点在于它对背离的处理方式。
Now, one of the things that makes my software a little bit different than most of the software on the market, it refers to divergences.

216
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:11,820
大多数订单流软件只会在新高或平高处出现负Delta，或新低或平低处出现正Delta时，提示存在背离。
Most divergence, most order flow software will just say you have a divergence when you have a new or equal high and a negative delta, or a new or equal low and a positive delta.

217
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:19,320
我还想更进一步，想看到价格行为。在单根K线上确认市场方向。
I'd like to think of it a step further. I want to see price action. In the individual bar confirm the direction of the market.

218
00:18:19,320 --> 00:18:28,020
所以说，如果我在高点做看跌背离，我希望这根K线收阴线。
So, you know, if I'm taking a bearish divergence at a high, I want to see the bar close negative.

219
00:18:28,020 --> 00:18:29,420
我不希望它收阳线。
I don't want to see it close positive.

220
00:18:29,420 --> 00:18:31,420
我不希望K线在高点附近交易。
I don't want the bar to be trading up near the high.

221
00:18:31,420 --> 00:18:33,520
我希望它收阴线。
I want it to be closing negative.

222
00:18:34,220 --> 00:18:39,920
对我来说，这只是确认时的一个小小的视觉辅助步骤。
I mean, that's just, for me, just a little extra visual step as far as confirmation.

223
00:18:44,868 --> 00:18:51,768
好的，看涨极端失衡就是出现看涨极端失衡时。
Okay, so bullish extreme imbalances is when you have a bullish extreme imbalance.

224
00:18:51,768 --> 00:18:55,268
它出现在K线底部有卖盘失衡，但收盘价高于开盘价时。
It occurs when there's a selling imbalance at the bottom of a bar that closed higher than it opened.

225
00:18:55,568 --> 00:19:00,768
在 OrderFlows 交易软件中，会用箭头标出。
On the OrderFlows Trader software, it's going to be highlighted with an arrow.

226
00:19:01,268 --> 00:19:06,368
这种情况下，你会看到常规卖盘失衡，而 K线收盘价高于开盘价。
In this case, you'll see the normal selling imbalance and the bar closed higher.

227
00:19:06,568 --> 00:19:07,868
软件会画出箭头。
You'll draw the arrow.

228
00:19:08,168 --> 00:19:12,168
对我来说，这表明空头在 K线底部非常激进。
To me, that's a sign that sellers are really aggressive at the bottom of the bar.

229
00:19:13,668 --> 00:19:17,668
你懂的，他们试图压低市场，但没能继续下跌，市场又反弹了。
You know, and trying to push the market lower, but it couldn't go any lower, and the market popped back up.

230
00:19:19,868 --> 00:19:27,168
相反的情况是看跌极端失衡，即在 K线顶部出现买盘失衡，且收盘价低于开盘价。
The opposite would be a bearish extreme imbalance where at the top there is a buying imbalance of a bar that goes lower than where it opens.

231
00:19:27,268 --> 00:19:28,868
同样，软件也会画出箭头。
Again, here it's going to draw the arrow.

232
00:19:29,268 --> 00:19:35,368
我的订单流软件是我目前知道唯一一款会...
My order flow software is the only software that I'm aware of that...

233
00:19:35,868 --> 00:19:37,568
会画出这些箭头来提示你。
Draws those arrows that highlights to you.

234
00:19:37,668 --> 00:19:43,968
有人会说，哦，这是陷阱交易者。你懂的，算是也不是。其实是那些做多错判、无法再推动市场的人。
People say, oh, that's trap traders. You know, it is and it isn't. It's people that are long and wrong and can't move the market any further.

235
00:19:45,568 --> 00:19:51,268
所以说，当看跌极端失衡出现时，我会考虑做空。
Okay, so, you know, bearish extreme imbalance when it occurs, I mean, look to get short.

236
00:19:51,668 --> 00:19:54,968
这是个快速交易，是个快速反转。
It's a quick trade. It's a quick reversal.

237
00:19:54,968 --> 00:19:59,568
我不期望这些极端失衡，无论看涨还是看跌，
I don't expect these extreme imbalances, the bullish or bearish ones, to be.

238
00:20:00,068 --> 00:20:04,668
会真正标志着长期趋势的终结或新趋势的开启。
Really the end of a long-term trend or the start of a new trend.

239
00:20:05,168 --> 00:20:12,568
对我来说，看跌极端失衡更多是短期指标，而非长期指标。
For me, the bearish extreme imbalances are more of a short-term indicator. than a longer term indicator.

240
00:20:12,968 --> 00:20:27,868
我之前说，它会在趋势快速结束时出现，你会看到小幅波动，但它并非纯粹的反转指标，不会明确标志趋势终结和新趋势开启。
I said it'll occur at the end of a trend pretty quick and you get a slight move but it's not a pure reversal indicator that will indicate the end of a trend and start of a new trend.

241
00:20:28,668 --> 00:20:30,168
反转指标通常会提示趋势的终点
Oftentimes a reversal indicator

242
00:20:31,268 --> 00:20:37,168
但并不意味着新趋势的开始
will signal the end of a trend, but doesn't necessarily mean that it's the beginning of a new trend.

243
00:20:40,668 --> 00:20:44,768
背离交易听起来很直接，但其实有很多需要注意的地方
Divergence trading sounds great and straightforward, but there are caveats with it.

244
00:20:46,168 --> 00:20:52,268
就像我之前说的，在趋势市场中，会出现很多背离
Like I was talking about earlier, in a trending market, there's going to be a lot of divergences appearing.

245
00:20:53,468 --> 00:20:57,968
我更倾向于从背离中获取更多信息，而不仅仅是背离本身
I like to get a little bit extra out of the divergence rather than just having a divergence.

246
00:20:59,268 --> 00:21:08,068
因为，你懂的，比如市场上涨时，多头总会在某个点获利了结，就会出现负Delta，从而触发背离
Because, you know, say a market is rallying, right, and the people are going to take profits at some point, you will get a negative delta, and, you know, that will kick off a divergence.

247
00:21:08,068 --> 00:21:18,868
我想看到价格被拒绝，所以我想看到一个比率，你懂的，要么在背离出现时，要么在不久之后
I want to see price being rejected, so I want to see a ratio, you know, just occurring either as soon as the divergence occurs or shortly thereafter.

248
00:21:19,968 --> 00:21:24,868
所以说在快速趋势市场中，会有失败的背离，这是不可避免的
So in a rapidly trending market, there will be failed divergences. That's just a fact of life.

249
00:21:24,968 --> 00:21:29,168
结合单印区、小单成交或大印的背离信号更具选择性和威力。
Divergences with single prints, small prints, or large prints are more selective and more powerful.

250
00:21:30,968 --> 00:21:35,968
创新高时，应看到多头激进买入的形式，即堆叠失衡区。
When you're making new highs, you should see aggressive buying in the form of stacked buying imbalances.

251
00:21:35,968 --> 00:21:40,368
创新低时，应看到空头激进卖出的形式，即买卖失衡。
When you're making new lows, you should be seeing aggressive selling in the form of selling imbalances.

252
00:21:42,868 --> 00:21:49,868
通常供需关系正在转变，可从堆叠失衡区中观察到。
Usually a shift in supply and demand is occurring and can be seen in stacked imbalances.

253
00:21:50,268 --> 00:21:55,168
所以说，当你看到堆叠失衡区时，堆叠失衡区的定义是什么？
So when you're seeing a stacked imbalance, by definition, what is a stacked imbalance?

254
00:21:55,168 --> 00:22:01,668
堆叠失衡区通常是指三个或更多失衡区连续叠加。
A stacked imbalance is usually three or more imbalances occurring on top of each other.

255
00:22:02,668 --> 00:22:08,768
在一根K线内，可能有三个失衡区，但它们可能并非连续叠加，
Now, you can have, in a bar, you can have three imbalances, maybe they're not stacked on each other, you know, it could be,

256
00:22:09,768 --> 00:22:17,668
你懂的，可能是两个，然后是正常价格水平，再出现一个，但通常来说，从视觉上看堆叠失衡区...
you know, two, and then a normal price level, and then another one, but usually, I mean, visually, seeing a stacked imbalance is...

257
00:22:18,168 --> 00:22:21,368
这点更重要，因为通常是有人在突破某个价位时大量买入。
Slightly more important because usually it's somebody that's buying it up through a level.

258
00:22:21,868 --> 00:22:31,168
我说供需在转变时，你会看到高点出现卖盘失衡，想想看。
And when I say a shift in supply and demand is occurring, when you see an imbalance occurring, selling imbalance occurring at a high, think about it.

259
00:22:31,268 --> 00:22:31,668
发生了什么？
What's happened?

260
00:22:31,768 --> 00:22:35,768
市场上涨，多头推动价格创新高。
The markets rallied up, made a high as people were buying.

261
00:22:35,968 --> 00:22:36,968
需求确实存在。
The demand was there.

262
00:22:37,068 --> 00:22:40,568
但到高点后突然盘整，接着你会看到...
But then you plateau at a high and all of a sudden you see...

263
00:22:41,168 --> 00:22:46,568
空头大量涌入，以卖盘失衡的形式出现，这说明空头已经接管了市场。
Selling come in and it's very aggressive in the form of selling imbalances, well, the sellers have taken over now.

264
00:22:46,768 --> 00:22:49,568
他们正在市场上抛出多余的供给。
They're laying off their excess supply in the market.

265
00:22:51,468 --> 00:22:54,468
在低点同样如此。
And the same is true for at a low.

266
00:22:54,568 --> 00:22:57,568
如果你看到买盘失衡，这种买盘失衡出现在低点附近，
If you see a buying imbalance, that buying imbalance come in off a low,

267
00:22:59,068 --> 00:23:02,568
说明需求正在回升，且需求非常积极。
You're seeing demand pick up and demand being very aggressive.

268
00:23:03,068 --> 00:23:10,268
所以说，我更倾向于结合市场背景来判断。你懂的，我更倾向于在低点附近寻找买盘失衡，在高点附近寻找卖盘失衡。
So, you know, I said, I prefer to take them in context of the market. You know, I'd rather take a buying imbalance near a low, a selling imbalance near the high.

269
00:23:12,868 --> 00:23:14,568
好的，接下来讲反转设置。
Okay, so reversal setups.

270
00:23:15,668 --> 00:23:20,968
我会通过一系列实例，让你知道如何识别并实时捕捉这些信号。
I'll just go through a bunch of examples here just to give you an idea of how to see them and catch them in real time.

271
00:23:21,568 --> 00:23:27,068
我习惯标出当天的高点和低点，这样就能判断市场何时反转。
I like to plot the high and the low for the day. So I know when the market's going to reverse.

272
00:23:27,068 --> 00:23:32,168
我不想反复查看低点或高点的位置。
I don't want to have to keep referring to something to see where the low has been or where the high is.

273
00:23:33,068 --> 00:23:34,968
大多数软件，比如我用的 NinjaTrader（软件名）
Most software, NinjaTrader,

274
00:23:35,468 --> 00:23:41,568
会自动画出当日低点的参考线，就是这条红线
which I use as an indicator that will draw the draw line where the low of the day is, which is this red line.

275
00:23:42,268 --> 00:23:44,968
这条较细的红线是昨天的低点
This thinner red line is yesterday's low.

276
00:23:45,668 --> 00:23:53,068
不过，你懂的，我还想看看市场对前一交易日高低点以及当日低点的反应
But, you know, for today, you know, I do like to see how market reacts to the previous day's highs and lows as well as today's lows.

277
00:23:54,468 --> 00:23:56,668
所以这里形成了低点，然后呢？
So we made the low here, and what do you have?

278
00:23:56,668 --> 00:24:00,368
出现了阻挡成交量，比率是 0.57
You have stopping volume, you know, ratio of 0.57.

279
00:24:00,368 --> 00:24:04,568
低于我偏好的 0.69，而且市场确实有反应
It's below 0.69 that I like, and the market reacted to it.

280
00:24:05,668 --> 00:24:07,368
好，这是一个例子
Okay, so here's an example.

281
00:24:07,468 --> 00:24:13,968
价格一路下行，不断走低。你能看到市场价格在持续下跌。
We're working our way down to a low level, you know, coming down, coming down. You can see the market price action is moving down.

282
00:24:14,368 --> 00:24:19,168
触及低点后，这里并没有出现理想的比率。目前是15，属于平均水平。
You hit this low, you don't necessarily have a ratio here right now. You know, it's an average number, 15.

283
00:24:19,968 --> 00:24:22,868
市场开始回升，出现买盘失衡。
Market starts ticking back up. You get a buying imbalance.

284
00:24:23,068 --> 00:24:27,568
价格下跌后触及低点，你在寻找反转信号。这里就出现了。
You came down. You hit a low. You're looking for the reversal sign. And here it is. Boom.

285
00:24:27,568 --> 00:24:29,868
你得到买盘失衡，还有你喜欢的比率。
You get the buying imbalance and you got a ratio that you like.

286
00:24:31,168 --> 00:24:34,568
这是小型道指期货，YM，3分钟图。
Okay, this is a mini Dow, the YM. It's a three-minute chart.

287
00:24:36,468 --> 00:24:37,368
那这里有什么？
And what do you have?

288
00:24:37,568 --> 00:24:40,368
第一次触及低点时，就出现了这个信号。
The first time you hit the low, you have that.

289
00:24:40,468 --> 00:24:45,468
K线极端位置出现极端失衡
Extreme imbalance at the extreme of the bar.

290
00:24:45,868 --> 00:24:46,868
这里是比率
In this case, it's a ratio.

291
00:24:46,968 --> 00:24:51,568
还有背离，所有信号都齐了。所以说
You also have a divergence. It's like all systems go. Boom.

292
00:24:52,068 --> 00:24:57,268
先有一波反弹，之后回落，再次触及低点，出现背离，然后确实反弹了
You got a bit of a rally. Later, you came down. You hit the low again. You have a divergence. It did rally.

293
00:24:57,568 --> 00:25:00,368
我并不是说一定要交易这个背离
I'm not necessarily saying to take this divergence.

294
00:25:00,368 --> 00:25:01,568
我更倾向于有比率支持
I like to have some ratios.

295
00:25:02,368 --> 00:25:06,368
比如下方有蓝色比率数值，或者像这里的失衡
You know, some blue color ratio number down there, or, you know, like this imbalance you have here.

296
00:25:06,768 --> 00:25:12,368
这个例子不错，你能拿到20、30个Tick的收益。
You know, this one was, you know, a decent one. You could have got 20, 30 ticks out of it.

297
00:25:12,368 --> 00:25:16,568
我并不是说你要一路持有到最低点，再在反弹时抓住机会。
I'm not saying you would have ridden it all the way back down here and caught it on the way back up.

298
00:25:16,968 --> 00:25:21,468
但现实来说，你可以在15、16这个点位进场。
But, you know, I mean, realistically, you could have got in, you know, 15, 16.

299
00:25:22,168 --> 00:25:26,268
交易价格最高能到30以上，这是笔不错的交易。
You know, traded up above 30, so that's a fair trade.

300
00:25:29,840 --> 00:25:35,240
再次强调，这是失衡，但它是基于比率出现的。
Again, this is the imbalance, but it's on the back of ratios.

301
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:39,840
这里有三个比率，价格一路下行，突然出现阻挡成交量。
You've got three ratios here. You're working your way down. Boom, you get some stopping volume.

302
00:25:39,840 --> 00:25:46,940
这个比率平衡状态的低点显示这里有阻挡成交量，接着出现单印区，然后是买盘失衡。
This ratio balance low indicating some stopping volume here, followed by a single print, and you get your buying imbalance.

303
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:52,040
所以说，这其实是反转信号，这些只是确认，然后市场就一路走高。
So, I mean, really, this is the reversal indicator, and these are just confirmations, and the market just trades higher.

304
00:25:54,240 --> 00:25:58,540
看这里，这是E-迷你合约图，时间是早上5点30分。
You come up here, this is an E-mini chart, this is early morning, 5.30 in the morning.

305
00:26:00,824 --> 00:26:02,424
你在高点触发了一个比率。
You hit a ratio right up here at the high.

306
00:26:02,624 --> 00:26:10,124
相对于这些数值，它显示高位有成交量阻挡市场。
It's indicating, relative to these numbers here, but it's indicating some sort of volume up here to sort of stop the market.

307
00:26:10,924 --> 00:26:12,024
然后市场就回落了。
And the market came down.

308
00:26:12,724 --> 00:26:16,124
如果你对这里的情况还有疑问，你会看到堆叠失衡区。
If you're not convinced what you're seeing here, you're seeing a stacked imbalance.

309
00:26:16,524 --> 00:26:23,224
现在，我想指出的是，堆叠失衡区是指连续三个失衡。
Now, one of the things... And I just want to point out is, you know, a stack imbalance is three imbalances in a row.

310
00:26:23,724 --> 00:26:29,724
但有些K线里的失衡是分散的。
But there's going to be bars where you have the imbalances, but you have them spaced out.

311
00:26:29,824 --> 00:26:34,224
你这里有265，然后是59、79和69。
You've got 265, and this one, 59 is not, 79 and 69.

312
00:26:34,624 --> 00:26:37,624
仍然是失衡，但堆叠方式不同。
It's still imbalanced, but it's stacked a bit differently.

313
00:26:38,624 --> 00:26:41,224
只是没有以这种方式堆叠在一起。
It's just not stacked on top of each other in that sense.

314
00:26:44,116 --> 00:26:49,616
下一个例子，你往下看，触及低点后出现阻挡成交量，市场随即反弹回升。
And this next one, you know, working your way down, you hit the low, you got stopping volume, and the market rallies back up.

315
00:26:49,816 --> 00:26:52,116
这些情况，你每天都会看到。
You're going to see these things, you know, daily.

316
00:26:52,516 --> 00:26:56,316
所以说，你要有自己寻找的设置，寻找的市场信号。
You know, that's why you should have setups that you're looking for, things you're looking for in the market.

317
00:26:56,816 --> 00:27:00,116
就像我常说的，你要关注市场触及低点时的表现。
Like I say, you want to see when the market reaches a low.

318
00:27:00,616 --> 00:27:01,516
怎么知道这是低点？
How do you know this is low?

319
00:27:01,516 --> 00:27:02,716
因为出现了正Delta。
Well, you've got positive delta.

320
00:27:02,716 --> 00:27:06,816
这是市场可能反转的第一个信号。
It's your first sign of maybe the market's turning around.

321
00:27:07,116 --> 00:27:08,416
出现正Delta。
You have a positive delta.

322
00:27:08,416 --> 00:27:12,316
我在说，在这一连串阴线持续下跌之后，
I said on the back of all these bars that are red going down, down, down, down, down.

323
00:27:12,616 --> 00:27:13,016
市场反转了。
It turns.

324
00:27:13,116 --> 00:27:20,316
出现阳线，正Delta，还有比率。这在提示你，市场可能会有一波上涨。
It's a green bar, positive delta. You have a ratio. It's telling you, hey, the market's poised to put in a little bit of a move higher.

325
00:27:25,888 --> 00:27:30,388
好，再看一个例子。这里到达低点，就是这条红线的位置。
Okay, here's another one. What you have, you're at your low, this is this red line here.

326
00:27:30,888 --> 00:27:35,588
这里没有比率，也没有正Delta，但下一根K线，突然出现买盘失衡。
You don't have a ratio down here, you don't have a positive delta, but in the next bar, boom, you get the buying imbalance.

327
00:27:35,988 --> 00:27:39,088
你懂的，我更倾向于在低点附近抓住买盘失衡。
You know, I said I'd much rather take buying imbalances right off the low.

328
00:27:39,388 --> 00:27:42,888
这里出现正Delta，所以市场开始上涨。
You got the positive deltas appearing here, so you know, the market moves higher.

329
00:27:44,588 --> 00:27:47,788
你不一定总能精准抓到最低点。
You're not always going to be able to pick the exact low.

330
00:27:47,888 --> 00:27:50,088
比如这里，你可能觉得市场会继续上涨。
Like here, maybe you thought the market is going to go higher.

331
00:27:51,088 --> 00:27:52,488
但这里出现了正Delta。
But you have a positive delta.

332
00:27:52,488 --> 00:27:53,288
但你没抓到最低点。
You didn't hit the low.

333
00:27:54,188 --> 00:27:56,088
下一根K线也没什么让你兴奋的信号。
But there's nothing in the next bar to get you excited.

334
00:27:56,188 --> 00:27:58,988
这里才是最低点，但这根K线也没什么让你兴奋的。
You hit the low here. Nothing in this bar to get you excited.

335
00:27:59,188 --> 00:28:04,288
这里才会让你兴奋，你会看到买卖失衡甚至在下一根K线出现。
This is where you're going to get excited. And you're seeing the buying imbalance is occurring even in the next bar.

336
00:28:04,788 --> 00:28:08,388
所以你要结合市场背景来解读一切。
So you've got to read everything in context of the market.

337
00:28:08,488 --> 00:28:13,888
如果你想寻找反转信号，要关注市场是否处于低点。
If you're looking for a reverse to happen, look for the market to be at the low.

338
00:28:14,388 --> 00:28:16,688
你需要先有一个趋势才能反转。
You want to have a trend to reverse.

339
00:28:19,188 --> 00:28:27,188
你要寻找可能反转的区域，可能是低点、高点，或者摆动低点、摆动高点。
You've got to look for areas where it's going to possibly reverse, and that could be the low, that could be the high, or a swing low or a swing high.

340
00:28:29,832 --> 00:28:33,732
好，这是E-迷你的K线图。它已经上涨了一段。
Okay, so this is an E-mini chart. It's rallied up.

341
00:28:33,932 --> 00:28:40,032
好，这根K线里也没有信号，但这是波段的高点，这很重要。
Okay, again, nothing here in this bar, but it's the high of a move. That's important.

342
00:28:40,132 --> 00:28:44,432
所以你要看接下来几根K线的情况，看是否会出现反转。
So you want to see what's happening in the next few bars, that a reversal is going to come.

343
00:28:44,432 --> 00:28:47,532
就像我之前说的，反转不一定会在波段终点立刻出现。
Like I said, it's not always going to come boom right at the end of a move.

344
00:28:47,832 --> 00:28:51,032
可能会在波段结束后不久发生，就像我之前说的。
It may happen a little bit after the move, like I said.

345
00:28:51,632 --> 00:28:55,832
所以说，反转可能发生后，市场也可能横盘。
You know, a reversal can happen and the market could go sideways.

346
00:28:56,432 --> 00:28:58,632
然后你要看哪里会出现强势。
Then you want to see where the strength is going to come in.

347
00:28:58,932 --> 00:29:04,532
你在这里看到了卖出失衡，这就是市场告诉你要下跌的强势信号。
And you see it here with the selling imbalance. That's the strength in the market that's telling you the market's going to go lower.

348
00:29:04,932 --> 00:29:09,832
别觉得必须精准抓到波段的最高点或最低点。
Don't think that you have to pick the exact high or the low of a move.

349
00:29:10,332 --> 00:29:13,432
你懂的，很多时候市场触及高点或低点后会横盘。
You know, oftentimes the market hits a high or a low and goes sideways.

350
00:29:13,932 --> 00:29:18,632
然后，空头或多头会展现他们的强势，这就是你要寻找的。
Then, you know, the sellers or the buyers are going to show their strength. That's what you want to look for.

351
00:29:19,132 --> 00:29:23,332
所以说，这就是你看到供需变化的地方。
And, you know, that's where you're seeing the change in supply and demand.

352
00:29:24,432 --> 00:29:25,832
好的，这是10年期国债图。
Okay, this is a 10-year chart.

353
00:29:25,832 --> 00:29:32,332
你懂的，10年期国债这类成交量巨大的市场，往往是订单流的绝佳示例。
You know, 10 years, you know, markets that have tremendous volume sometimes make great examples for order flow.

354
00:29:32,632 --> 00:29:37,632
这里你看到价格回落至低点，出现了背离，但我不确定这是否就是最低点。
And what you're seeing here is you came down into low, you have a divergence, but I'm not necessarily convinced that this is the low yet.

355
00:29:37,932 --> 00:29:44,932
我在等下一根K线，突然，我在这里看到了。K线底部成交量很大，比率是我喜欢的0.008。
I'm waiting for the next bar, and boom, I see it here. I see the heavy volume at the bottom of the bar. I see the ratio that I like, 0.008.

356
00:29:45,332 --> 00:29:47,632
你懂的，这告诉我K线底部成交量很大。
You know, it's telling me there's heavy volume at the bottom of the bar.

357
00:29:47,632 --> 00:29:51,932
这些额外的买盘失衡只是锦上添花，市场随即上涨。
You know, these extra buying imbalances are just icing on the cake, and the market traded higher.

358
00:29:53,932 --> 00:29:57,732
同样，10年期国债这次在低点，你也看到了自己喜欢的比率。
Again, the 10 years, this time, you know, at the low, you do have the ratio that you like.

359
00:29:57,632 --> 00:30:04,232
比如，你一路下跌，然后出现这根十字星K线，Delta也很小。
Like, you know, you came in, came down, down, down. You have this doji bar and you have a fairly small delta.

360
00:30:04,632 --> 00:30:06,832
你懂的，这是形势开始变化的第一个信号。
You know, that's the first sign that things are starting to change.

361
00:30:07,232 --> 00:30:11,232
然后这里出现一个小单成交，显示下方有价格拒绝。
Then you get this small print down here indicating there's price rejection below here.

362
00:30:12,132 --> 00:30:13,532
并且出现买盘失衡。
And you have a buying imbalance.

363
00:30:14,432 --> 00:30:18,332
所以说，它在告诉你，嘿，准备反弹了。
So it's telling you that, hey, I'm getting ready to rally.

364
00:30:19,532 --> 00:30:20,632
系好安全带。
Buckle your seatbelts.

365
00:30:23,032 --> 00:30:25,332
这是Buden图表，德国10年期图表。
This is a Buden chart. It's a German 10-year chart.

366
00:30:25,732 --> 00:30:28,732
这里也有类似情况，价格触及低点。
And you have something similar here. You came into the lows.

367
00:30:28,832 --> 00:30:33,932
这里并没有特别之处，低点在这里，所以离低点差几个Tick。
Not necessarily anything here. I mean, the low is here, so you're a couple ticks off.

368
00:30:34,132 --> 00:30:39,132
但第二次触及低点时，成交量大幅减少，所以出现单印区，这是一个比率。
But the second time you hit that low, you did it on much less volume. And so you have a single print. It's a ratio.

369
00:30:41,232 --> 00:30:48,632
如果你还不确定低点是否已形成，那么在下一个成交单，下一个K线，你会看到另一个单印区。
If you're not necessarily convinced that, okay, this, you know, hey, the low is now here, in the next print, you're seeing, in the next bar, you're seeing another single print.

370
00:30:49,132 --> 00:30:51,732
现在它在告诉你，嘿，别错过这笔交易。
Now it's telling you, hey, idiot, don't miss this trade.

371
00:30:52,132 --> 00:30:56,332
你懂的，我之前用单印区告诉过你，市场在拒绝这个低点。
You know, I told you here with the single print that the market was rejecting the low.

372
00:30:56,832 --> 00:31:00,532
现在，我再次给你展示，别错过这笔交易。
Now, I'm showing it to you again, you know, don't miss the trade.

373
00:31:01,032 --> 00:31:03,132
所以说，我之前说过，有时候，
So, you know, I said, sometimes, you know,

374
00:31:04,332 --> 00:31:08,132
你可能看到这根K线，心想，好，这笔交易结束了。
You may see this bar here thinking, okay, this is the end of the trade.

375
00:31:08,332 --> 00:31:09,732
价格上涨后又回落。
It goes up and comes back down again.

376
00:31:10,132 --> 00:31:10,932
你泄气了吗？
Are you discouraged?

377
00:31:11,032 --> 00:31:16,432
不，它并未跌破低点。实际上，它只是回落到相同低点，但成交量大幅减少。
No, it didn't take out the low. In fact, it just came down to the low, same level, but with much less volume.

378
00:31:17,032 --> 00:31:26,832
这是我最常用的套路之一，但我特别喜欢看到你第二次或第三次测试低点或高点时，成交量明显缩小。
That's one of my bread and butter setups, but I do like to see when you test a low or test a high the second time, and even to a lesser extent the third time, and do it on much less volume.

379
00:31:27,632 --> 00:31:28,432
出现单印区。
on a single print.

380
00:31:29,232 --> 00:31:30,132
我特别喜欢这种情况。
I really love it.

381
00:31:30,632 --> 00:31:44,932
但你会发现，低点出现后，市场先横盘，然后随着价格远离低点，供需关系开始变化。
But what you're seeing is you're seeing the low come in, market goes sideways a little bit, and then it's showing you the change in supply and demand as the market starts to move away from that low.

382
00:31:47,832 --> 00:31:49,532
好，最后再看一个足迹图。
Okay, lastly, this is a boon chart again.

383
00:31:49,732 --> 00:31:54,032
市场持续下跌，不断创新低，再创新低。突然，它触及低点。
The market's coming down, working its way down, making new lows, making new lows, making new lows. Boom, you hit the low.

384
00:31:54,932 --> 00:32:01,632
出现背离，Delta为小幅正值。虽然不是你想看到的最强正Delta，但毕竟是正的。
You have a divergence, you know, a small positive delta. It's not the strongest positive delta that you'd like to see, but it's positive nevertheless.

385
00:32:02,132 --> 00:32:08,032
同样，这里出现单印区，为你开启一个漂亮的反转前奏。市场开始上涨。
Again, you have a single print, so you're kicking off a nice pre-show. And the market starts moving higher.

386
00:32:08,332 --> 00:32:17,332
可能你有点害怕，你懂的，在这根K线做多，因为你看到一个大负Delta，而正Delta很小。
Maybe you're a little bit scared, you know, getting long off this bar because you see this big negative delta and you just have a small positive delta.

387
00:32:17,932 --> 00:32:29,932
你懂的，接下来这根K线，甚至226价位的小单成交，比率为31，都在提示你：空头不想再把市场往下压了。
You know, this next bar and even this bar here at 226 with the small print giving you the ratio of 31 is indicating, hey, you know, sellers aren't interested in pushing the market any lower.

388
00:32:31,632 --> 00:32:35,032
而这种情况下，多头接管了，市场继续走高。
And in this case, buyers are taking over and the market's going higher.

389
00:32:36,232 --> 00:32:39,132
好，这就是第16课《订单流反转设置》的全部内容。
So that's the end of Lesson 16, Reversal Setups.

390
00:32:39,132 --> 00:32:43,032
下一课，我会讲解如何识别和交易订单流延续设置。
In the next lesson, I'll explain how to spot and trade order flow continuation setups.

391
00:32:44,132 --> 00:32:50,132
所以说，像我之前说的，我倾向于把反转和延续分开来看，但我一直在寻找这两种机会。
So, you know, like I said, I tend to split up reversals and continuations, but I'm always looking for them.

392
00:32:50,432 --> 00:32:55,532
而且，你懂的，我在交易日中会尽量利用反转和延续两种机会。
And, you know, I try to take advantage of both reversals and continuations during the trading day.

393
00:32:56,232 --> 00:32:57,032
好的，谢谢大家。
So thank you.

394
00:32:57,632 --> 00:32:58,832
下一课见。
See you in the next lesson.

